autonumber

User -> LoginPanel: click Create Account
LoginPanel -> LoginController: showCreateAccountScreen(): void
LoginController -> CreateAccountPanel: show(): void

User -> CreateAccountPanel: enterDetails(username, password, role)
User -> CreateAccountPanel: clickSubmit()

CreateAccountPanel -> CreateAccountController: handleRegistration(UserDto)

CreateAccountController -> AuthService: registerUser(UserDto): RegistrationResponse

AuthService -> AuthService: validateUserDetails(UserDto)

alt is invalid or user exists
AuthService --> CreateAccountController: return RegistrationResponse(FAIL, errorMsg)
else is valid
AuthService -> Repo: saveUser(user: User): boolean
Repo -> Storage: insertUser(record: UserRecord): boolean
Storage --> Repo: return boolean
Repo --> AuthService: return boolean
AuthService --> CreateAccountController: return RegistrationResponse(SUCCESS, successMsg)
end

CreateAccountController --> CreateAccountPanel: return RegistrationResponse

CreateAccountPanel -> User: displayMessage(response.message)

@enduml
